<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu rises to 4.6625 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu rises to 4.6625 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.6625 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6655 on March 6.</p>
<p>				    Mar 11	Mar 6</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6625	4.6655</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    425,000     300,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
